        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 27, touch 16, flat-footed 22 (+1 size, +5 dex, +7 armor, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 149 [208] (13d10+78)</p><p>Fort +15, Ref +13, Will +7</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee +1 Greataxe +26/+21/+16 (1d10+18/x3)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 28, DEX 20, CON 24, INT 12, WIS 16, CHA 8</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +21; CMD +36</p><p>Feats Cleave, Great Cleave, Greater Weapon Focus (Greataxe), Greater Weapon Specialization (Greataxe), Power Attack, Weapon Focus (Greataxe), Weapon Specialization (Greataxe)</p><p>Skills Fly +25</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
